# DROP_JUNK — his bag throws out the junk: dirt, cobblestone, gravel, rotten flesh,
# seeds and the rest of TidyRule.JUNK are dropped at his feet — dropped, never destroyed, so a thing
# he wanted after all is still on the ground. The choosing is Java's (Tidy).
function effect()
    /execute as ${TARGET} run tag @s add mfam_drop_junk
    /playsound minecraft:item.bundle.drop_contents master @a ~ ~ ~ 1 1.0
end
